.Dd August 4, 2026
.Dt WCLIPMENU 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wclipmenu
.Nd pick from kaprica clipboard history via a wmenu picker
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h
.Nm
.Op Ar list | image
.Op Fl n Ar count
.Nm
.Ar copy Ar id
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a zero-footprint clipboard picker for Wayland. On demand it reads the
history of the
.Sy kaprica
clipboard daemon through its
.Sy kapc
CLI, presents the entries in a
.Sy wmenu
picker, and copies the selection back to the clipboard before exiting.
It runs only when invoked, keeps no resident process and polls nothing.
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Nm
picks from the text history
.Pq Sy text/plain
. With
.Ar image
it picks from the image history
.Pq Sy image/png ,
rendering thumbnail previews with
.Sy ImageMagick
and showing them through the
.Sy wmenu-caos
picker, which supports the
.Sy [img:\&] PNG protocol.
Text selections are copied back with
.Sy kapc copy ;
image selections with
.Sy kapc paste
piped into
.Sy wl-copy --foreground
so browsers on the
.Sy wl_data_device
protocol receive the full image.
.Pp
The picker filter is case-insensitive. Pressing
.Sy Enter
copies the selected entry, pressing
.Sy Esc
cancels.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag
.It Fl h
Print usage and exit.
.It Ar list
Print the snippet lines of the text history to stdout instead of picking.
.It Ar image
Pick from the image history with thumbnail previews.
.It Ar copy Ar id
Copy the history entry with the given id back to the clipboard and exit.
.It Fl n Ar count
Limit the number of history entries fetched (default 100, clamped to 1-10000).
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag
.It Ev WCLIPMENU_WMENU
Path to the wmenu binary (default: wmenu from PATH).
.It Ev WCLIPMENU_LIMIT
Max entries fetched from kaprica (default: 100).
.It Ev WCLIPMENU_DB
Database file passed to kapc as -D (default: kaprica's own).
.El
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Caos
.Pq https://github.com/caos-obliquo
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr wmenu 1
.Xr kaprica 1
